    "evidence_classification_reason":  "The frozen blind review shows a +2.25 variant-minus-control difference on the registered cross_reference_leakage_control primary dimension and a +2.75 difference on reference_role_fidelity, with no observed mean degradation on semantic_compliance, aesthetic_quality, or technical_defects. EXP-017 also used the preregistered task-commitment and execution-receipt workflow for all eight imported samples, addressing the local execution-binding limitation that forced EXP-016 to remain inconclusive. The result is descriptive at n=4 per condition and is not a statistical-significance claim or provider-signed attestation. No numeric evidence-classification threshold was preregistered; supports is used here as a post-reveal qualitative evidence label under the repository evidence model.",
